XT></P><P ParaShape="216" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="59"><CHAR>○ 중대재해 예방 및 대응</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="216" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="59"><CHAR>○ 각종 유지관리용역 및 유지보수공사(전기,통신,음향,소방 등) 관리 및 감독</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="216" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="59"><CHAR>○ 기관 내 업무분장에 의한 업무처리 등</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="28" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="2" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="666" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="11491"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="13" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="109"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="28" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="4" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="666" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="36765"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="41" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="114"/></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="61" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="2" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="6128" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="11491"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="83" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="26"><CHAR>필요 역량</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="4" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="6128" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="36765"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="46" Style="0"><TEXT C