false" Header="false" Height="8018" Protect="false" RowAddr="7" RowSpan="1" Width="36765"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="216" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="59"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>○ 의사소통능력, 문제해결능력, 정보능력, 기술능력</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="216" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="59"><CHAR>○ 건물의 전기·소방설비의 구조, 기능, 조작 등 취급 방법에 관한 지식</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="216" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="59"><CHAR>○ 전기·소방 공사 시공 및 공사감독에 관한 지식</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="216" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="59"><CHAR>○ 건물의 전기·소방설비 점검 및 유지‧보수‧관리에 관한 지식</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="216" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="59"><CHAR>○ 행정업무 수행을 위한 문서작성 및 활용 지식</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="28" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="2" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="666" Protect="false" RowAddr="8" RowSpan="1" Width="11491"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="41" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="114"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="28" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="4" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="666" Protect="false" RowAddr="8" RowSpan="1" Width="36765"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="41" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="114"/></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="61" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="2" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="15977" Protect="false" RowAddr="9" RowSpan="1" Width="11491"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="