L></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="83" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="4007" Protect="false" RowAddr="11" RowSpan="1" Width="37982"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="115" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="150"><CHAR> 11. 최종학력증명서(학위증명서 또는 졸업증명서)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="84" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="4007" Protect="false" RowAddr="11" RowSpan="1" Width="9981"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="34" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="28"/></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="33" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="28"><CHAR> * 내용을 작성한 항목에 대하여 작성 여부 란에“○" 표시</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="33" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="64"><CHAR>【별지 제2호 서식】</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="33" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="125"/></P><P ParaShape="36" Style="18"><TEXT CharShape="56"/></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="60"><CHAR>(앞 면)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="83" Style="6"><TEXT CharShape="61"><CHAR>응 시 원 서 (원본)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="83" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="52"/></P><P ParaShape="12" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="153"><CHAR>통계청장  귀하</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="154"/></P><P ParaShape="11" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="155"><CHAR>  본인은 통계청 일반직공무원(공업주사보) 경력경쟁채용 선발시험에 응시하고자 원서를 제출하며 다음 사항을 서약합니다.</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="156"/></P><P ParaShape="116" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="156"><CHAR>  아래 기재사항은 사실과 다름없으며 만일 시험결과에 부당한 영향을 끼칠 목적으로 허위사실을 기재하였을 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="157"><CHAR>때에는 관계법령에 의거 당해시험이 정지 또는 무효가 되고 향후 5년간 응시자격이 정지되어도 이의를 제기하지 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="156"><CHAR>않겠습니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="118" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="154"><TABLE BorderFill="10" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="8" PageBreak="None" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="9"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1787730105" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" TextWrap="TopAndBottom" ZOrder="35"><SIZE Height="22288" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="48219" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="false" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="2925" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="85" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="8" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="1949" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="48219"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="83" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="26"><CHAR>응  시  원  서(원본) </CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="86" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="4" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2049" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="21431"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="80" Style="2"><TEXT CharShape="60"><CHAR>응시직급 및 분야</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="87" ColAddr="4" ColSpan="4" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2049" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="26788"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="80" Style="2"><TEXT CharShape="60"><CHAR>공업주사보 (전기)</CHAR></TEXT></P></